<title>USA: Jim Hjelm's Private Collection Q4 revs up.</title>
<headline>Jim Hjelm's Private Collection Q4 revs up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jim Hjelm's Private Collection Ltd said fourth quarter fiscal revenues for the period ending October 31 1996 were approximately $3.3 million, up from $2.2 million for the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company said revenues for the fiscal year ending October 31 were approximately $12.4 million, up from approximately $7.9 million for fiscal 1995.</p>
<p>The company said earnings for fiscal 1996 would not be available until mid-January.</p>
</text>
